| `domain/models/declaration_resolution.rs` | Company-number parsing policy, observation outcomes, deterministic mapping, checked aggregate and explicit role views. Private collection fields prevent bypassing link invariants; parent-payer selection belongs to the derived view, not identity mapping. |
