| `outbound/declaration_resolution.rs` | Cleaned Parquet decoding, manifest digests, mapping encoding and atomic publication. Reuse filesystem paths and existing error conventions. |
| `inbound/cli.rs` and ingestion-stage enum | Add offline `resolve`; require key and loader configuration only. |

The service hides integrity checks, deterministic grouping and publication behind one call. The consumer selects its reporting question. Roles remain the existing `FunderRole` enum; there is no second list of role names. The pure model owns resolution, while the adapter parses wire fields and rejects structural corruption, per `boundary-discipline`.

